          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मुड़णो (muṛṇo) is inherited from Sanskrit muṭati, \"twists\". CDIAL gives no Marwari form in this entry, but lists Hindi muṛnā, \"to be turned\" (CDIAL 10186). मोड़, \"a bend\", belongs to the same family."
            }
          ]
        },
